  },
  data: {
    LLM: "1. **Lead**: One player leads a card to the 'Play Pile'.\n2. **Response**: The opponent MUST beat the top card (higher of same suit or any Trump). If they beat it, they MUST 'Pile Up' a second card from their hand on top.\n3. **Failure to Beat**: If you cannot beat the card:\n   - If a plain card: Pick up only that card.\n   - If a Trump (not Ace): Pick up the top 3 cards of the pile.\n   - If the Ace of Trumps: Pick up the entire pile.",
    Player: "1. **Lead**: One player leads a card to the 'Play Pile'.\n2. **Response**: The opponent MUST beat the top card (higher of same suit or any Trump). If they beat it, they MUST 'Pile Up' a second card from their hand on top.\n3. **Failure to Beat**: If you cannot beat the card:\n   - If a plain card: Pick up only that card.\n   - If a Trump (not Ace): Pick up the top 3 cards of the pile.\n   - If the Ace of Trumps: Pick up the entire pile.",
    objective: 'Avoid being the last player left with cards in your hand after the stock is exhausted.',
    gameplay: "1. **Lead**: One player leads a card to the 'Play Pile'.\n2. **Response**: The opponent MUST beat the top card (higher of same suit or any Trump). If they beat it, they MUST 'Pile Up' a second card from their hand on top.\n3. **Failure to Beat**: If you cannot beat the card:\n   - If a plain card: Pick up only that card.\n   - If a Trump (not Ace): Pick up the top 3 cards of the pile.\n   - If the Ace of Trumps: Pick up the entire pile.",
